                           <h2 class="h1b">News</h2>
                           <div class="row">
                              <div class="col-xs-12 flex fx3"><article class="news"><a href="https://westmoreland.edu/news/scrape-and-sweep-keith-dvorchak.html"><img src="https://westmoreland.edu/scrape-and-sweep-keith-dvorchak-thumb3.jpg" alt="Keith Dvorchak" />	<h3 class="h2">From Kitchen Floor to Patent: The Invention of the Scrape & Sweep</h3><span class="date">Friday, November 6th, 2026</span>	<p>A good invention often starts with a problem that needs to be solved. For Westmoreland County Community College alumnus and MADE at Westmoreland member Keith Dvorchak, that problem was dried-up applesauce and crisped rice cereal on his kitchen floor.</p></a></article><article class="news"><a href="https://westmoreland.edu/news/sean-springob-military-to-medical-imaging.html"><img src="https://westmoreland.edu/sean-lisa-springob-thumb.png" alt="Sean and Lisa Springob" />	<h3 class="h2">From Military Service to Medical Imaging: Sean Springob Finds a New Path</h3><span class="date">Thursday, October 15th, 2026</span>	<p>For Sean Springob of Greensburg, choosing Westmoreland County Community College was about more than starting a new career. It was about finding a college that offered the academic opportunities, personal support and commitment to military and veteran students he was looking for, and one that had already become an important part of his family's story.</p></a></article><article class="news"><a href="https://westmoreland.edu/news/bob-miner-manufacturing-lab-ribbon-cutting.html"><img src="https://westmoreland.edu/bob-miner-ribbon-cutting-thumb3.jpg" alt="" />	<h3 class="h2">College Celebrates Opening of Bob Miner Advanced Manufacturing Lab</h3><span class="date">Friday, October 2nd, 2026</span>	<p>Westmoreland County Community College celebrated the opening of the
Bob Miner Advanced Manufacturing Lab on Friday, October 2, with a ribbon-cutting ceremony held in conjunction with National Manufacturing Day and the college's MADE for Tomorrow manufacturing day celebration.</p></a></article></div>
                              <div class="col-xs-12 text-right"><a class="btn lightGrad" href="/news/">All News</a></div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
